-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Rusty Axe is an axe that players start with when creating a fresh save. It's the second worst axe in the game, being also sold in basement of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $390.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Rusty axe is acting as an improvised grip, while being made out of typical yellow wood, using the default legacy wood material.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Rusty Axe replaced the <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Axe\" title=\"Wooden Axe\">Wooden Axe</a> as the best axe.</li>\n<li>A Rusty Axe can be found at <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a> but cannot be picked up and bought.</li>\n<li>The Rusty Axe can also be found on stumps.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c7/Axestump.png/revision/latest?cb=20251125230639\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A Rusty Axe found on a stump, not placed there as it has no owner.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c7/Axestump.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251125230639\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"137\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Axestump.png\" data-image-key=\"Axestump.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Axestump.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t 